{title: Alleluia}
{artist: Jesus Culture}
{key: F}
{source: https://www.cifraclub.com/jesus-culture/alleluia/}

{start_of_verse}
 [F]              [Fsus]
Father, we have come
        [Dm]   [C]  [Bb]
To bow down in worship
[F]               [Fsus]
Lifting up our hearts
    [Dm]     [C]    [Bb]
We bow down in praise
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Bb]   [F]   [C]
Alleluia
[Bb]     [F]      [C]
Lover of our souls
[Bb]   [F]   [C]
Alleluia
            [Gm]     [F/A]     [C]
 With all of Heaven we are singing
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
[F]                  [Fsus]
Bright and morning star
           [Dm]    [C]      [Bb]
Your eyes blaze like fire
[F]                [Fsus]
Shining like the sun
           [Dm]   [C]   [Bb]
You're our one Desire
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Bb]             [F]         [C]        [Dm]
All the angels cry out : "Holy is the Lord"
[Bb]             [F]         [C]        [Dm]
All the earth replies: "Holy are You"
[Bb]    [F]    [C]    [Dm]   [Bb]    [F]   [C]       [Dm]
Alleluia, Alleluia, Alleluia, Alleluia, Holy is the Lord
{end_of_chorus}
